---
description: Core stack and architecture for CP Retention Tracker
alwaysApply: true
---
- Stack: React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS, Supabase (Postgres), Google OAuth.
- Never use `any`. Prefer Zod schemas for all external data (CF API, LeetCode GraphQL, Supabase rows).
- Keep platform-specific code (Codeforces, LeetCode) behind a single normalized interface — see schema. Never let CF/LeetCode-specific fields leak past the sync layer.
- Be concise. Do not explain standard patterns unless asked. If a change is unnecessary, say "no changes needed".
- No speculative abstraction — build only what the current stage requires.